            "detailed_description": "Tcheco is back! After visiting the Castle of Lucio it's time for another herculean journey riding his shiny new skate.<br><br>Be prepared to survive even crazier stages! The challenge is also bigger, that's why Tcheco now is able to perform deadly attacks.<br>Smash, pulverize and destroy - but never lose that gorgeous smile!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Action/platform game with automatic scroll.<br></li><li>Play the levels in any order you want.<br></li><li>Graphics and sounds inspired by 8-bit aesthetics. Perfect for classic FC/NES game fans!<br></li><li>Compatible with Xinput gamepad and keyboard.<br></li><li>Easy to learn, simple gameplay.</li></ul>",
