                        "review": "This game controls great, has nice graphics, music, humor, was made 100% independently, and how can this be: it's so cheap!! You owe it to yourself to play it. If you want instant fun gameplay with no loading/waiting this is it. Press start, select a stage (you can play in any order you want) and before you know it you're skateboarding.\npros:\n- graphics\n- sound\n- controls\n- humor\n- price\n- guest cameos\n\ncons:\n- none that I can think of",
